{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32627","headline":"匡城寻薛闵秀才不遇 · 刘沧","name":"匡城寻薛闵秀才不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"音容一别近三年，往事空思意浩然。\n匹马东西何处客，孤城杨柳晚来蝉。\n路长草色秋山绿，川阔晴光远水连。\n不见故人劳梦寐，独吟风月过南燕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}